## Installation
The package can be installed by adding `finch` to your list of dependencies in `mix.exs`: | def deps do
  [
    {:finch, "~> 0.19"}
  ]
end | The docs can be found at [https://hexdocs.pm/finch](https://hexdocs.pm/finch).

